  {
   "id": "trails-in-the-sky-1st-chapter-314936@1.07",
   "gameId": "trails-in-the-sky-1st-chapter-314936",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.07",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-08-18T02:01:43.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Thank you for your continuous support for Trails in the Sky 1st Chapter. We are grateful for all the feedback we have received since launch and are now excited to announce that a Legacy Patch has been released as part of the Ver. 1.07 update. Ahead of Trails in the Sky 2nd Chapter’s release on September 17th, 2026, this localization update aligns key terminology with other entries in the Trails series.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Alongside our partners at Nihon Falcom, our goal for this patch was to ease the transition between Trails in the Sky 1st Chapter and later Trails titles. To achieve this, we prioritized updates to English terminology and pronunciations of terms based on how much they impacted continuity across the series.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We felt this was an important step in our goal to honor the expansive world-building of Trails and make Trails in the Sky 1st Chapter an accessible starting point for the series.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "In our ongoing commitment to delivering the best experience possible, this Legacy Patch includes the following adjustments:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Localization Update Overview",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Updated certain English voice and text to reflect legacy terminology",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Updated certain English voice to reflect legacy pronunciations",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Updated English UI and system text to reflect legacy terminology",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Updated French and German text for increased accuracy and consistency",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Updated certain voice and text lines to fix grammatical errors and improve dialogue flow",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Adjusted English Terminology",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Several major terms have been adjusted to align with terminology used in later titles in the series. Our overall goal with these updates was to align key in-game terminology and pronunciations with other titles in the Trails series. However, with the upcoming release of 2nd Chapter, we also felt it was important to preserve the experience of players who started the series with Trails in the Sky 1st Chapter as much as possible. With that goal in mind, terminology and character names exclusive to the Trails in the Sky games have been largely left unchanged.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A notable exception is the names of the Tetracyclic Towers, as these locations play a pivotal role in the story of 2nd Chapter, and thus have been adjusted to match the original games.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
